International", "https://www.greatamericanstations.com/stations/bellingham-wa-bel/"]}, {"start": 1960, "end": 1969, "headway_min": 720, "note": "The evening International was discontinued by 1960, leaving morning and afternoon trains.", "sources": ["NOT SOURCED AT SEGMENT LEVEL: the references below cover this line, but nothing has been checked specifically against this segment's start year, end year or service. Treat the dates and the headway as unverified. Supporting references for the line:", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairhaven_and_Southern_Railroad", "https://www.historylink.org/File/8688", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_(GN_train", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific_International", "https://www.greatamericanstations.com/stations/bellingham-wa-bel/"]}, {"start": 1969, "end": 1971, "headway_min": 1440, "note": "Morning service ended by 1969, leaving only the afternoon train, which ran on through the Burlington Northern merger of 1970. The last trains ran May 1 1971, the day Amtrak took over intercity passenger service.", "sources": ["NOT SOURCED AT SEGMENT LEVEL: the references below cover this line, but nothing has been checked specifically against this segment's start year, end year or service. Treat the dates and the headway as unverified. Supporting references for the line:", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairhaven_and_Southern_Railroad", "https://www.historylink.org/File/8688", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_(GN_train", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific_International", "https://www.greatamericanstations.com/stations/bellingham-wa-bel/"]}]}, "geometry": {"type": "LineString", "coordinates": [[-122.329544, 47.598782], [-122.329502, 47.602283], [-122.33405, 47.607138], [-122.344318, 47.609802], [-122.346795, 47.61113], [-122.349133, 47.611903], [-122.355246, 47.615417], [-122.379648, 47.634184], [-122.380545, 47.635897], [-122.380631, 47.65], [-122.381441, 47.651986], [-122.38346, 47.65411], [-122.391199, 47.660302], [